description.narrative:
"The ASTAE MDTF will contribute to encouraging and increasing WB client  countries# (i) adoption of solutions for scaling up deployment of  renewable energy technologiescomma (ii) adoption of solutions for scaling  up use of energy efficiency technologiescomma (iii) increased access to  modern energy servicescomma and (iv) enhanced policy decisions and  institutional capacity to plancomma managecomma and regulate the energy  sector.
 The ASTAE program will be assessed by the following indicators that  measure the leverage of the MDTF grants on WB investments:
 #	catalytic effect of ASTAE grants on WB projectcomma measured by total  lending that benefited from the ASTAE support;
 #	amount of new installed capacitycomma increase in generation of  electricity from renewable energy sourcescomma and the share of these  sources in the energy mixcomma under the WB projects supported by ASTAE;
 #	amount of energy savings resulting from energy efficiency  improvements under the WB projects supported by ASTAE;
 #	increase in number of households with access to modern or improved  energy services under the WB projects supported by ASTAE;
 #	amount of greenhouse gas emissions avoided under the WB projects  supported by ASTAE;
 #	number of countries in which policies and investment strategies were  influenced by ASTAE.
 All indicators are based on measurable WB projects metrics. Specific  targets for each indicator are set in the ASTAE business plancomma in  accordance to the strategy adopted in coordination with the donors."
